<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>PunchOut Simulator — Received PunchOutOrderMessage</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: monospace; max-width: 800px; margin: 2rem auto; padding: 0 1rem; }
        h1 { color: #333; }
        pre { background: #f5f5f5; padding: 1rem; overflow: auto; font-size: 0.8rem; }
        .success { color: green; font-weight: bold; }
        .empty { color: #999; }
        a { color: #007cba; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<h1>📦 PunchOut Simulator — Received Order Message</h1>

{% if cxml %}
    <p class="success">✅ PunchOutOrderMessage received.</p>
    <h2>cXML Payload (cXML-urlencoded)</h2>
    <pre>{{ cxml }}</pre>
{% else %}
    <p class="empty">No cXML payload received. The shopper may have cancelled the session.</p>
{% endif %}

<p><a href="/simulator/cxml">← Back to Simulator</a></p>

</body>
</html>
